    {
      "id": "2f79baaf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 实用部分\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ce82776b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "避免设置冲突的初始值非常重要。 作为本节练习的初始模型，让我们采用您在第02节中构建的阻尼旋转轮的模型。 它包含在文件中 `Начальные значения  - Исходная модель.engee`.\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![4 Начальные значения - Исходная модель.png](attachment:4 Начальные значения - Исходная модель.png)\n\n</div>\n\n初始角速度为**旋转阻尼器**块和**惯性**块设置。 由于它们是刚性连接的并且阻尼器的R端口是固定的，因此这些值不能彼此独立地设置。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4 Начальные значения - Исходная модель.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9059b5c4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1b5379c9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. 打开模型 `Начальные значения  - Исходная модель.engee`.\r\n\r\n2. 打开**旋转阻尼器**块设置窗口并展开**初始目标**部分。 确保参数**旋转速度**（角速度）设置为**无**。 \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b6cb043",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1e55b22",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![4 задание 1 решение.png](attachment:4 задание 1 решение.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4 задание 1 решение.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e8ba07af",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n初始值冲突的常见原因是在齿轮或杠杆等机构的两侧设置值。 例如，如果两个惯性元件通过齿轮系连接，则它们的角速度 $\\omega$ 和扭矩 $\\tau$ 按传动比相关 $\\frac{N_2}{N_1}$.\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![4 шестерёнки.png](attachment:4 шестерёнки.png)\n\n</div>\n\n$$\\omega_2=\\frac{N_1}{N_2} \\omega_1,$$\n\n$$\\tau_2=\\frac{N_2}{N_1} \\tau_1.$$\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "4 шестерёнки.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8e50431f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bf732d21",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "修改模型:\n\n1. 将**齿轮箱**块添加到模型中（齿轮传动完美）。 它在图书馆**物理建模->基础->力学->机制**。 \n2. 在模型中添加第二个**惯性**块。\n3. 将**齿轮箱**单元的S端口（它代表输入轴）连接到现有的**惯量**单元，端口O（输出轴）连接到新的**惯量**单元。\n4. 在**齿轮箱**单元的设置窗口中，将**齿轮比**参数的值设置为 `2`.\n5. 在新的**惯性**块的设置窗口中，将**惯性**参数（惯性矩）的值设置为 `0.05` kg*m^2。\n6. 运行模型。 绘制第一块**惯性**不时的角速度的依赖性。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb6bc675",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
